<td id="S4.T2.8.1.3.9" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">6.38</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T2.8.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T2.8.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">FastDrag <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib79" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhao et al., 2024f</a>)</cite></td>
